  m_Name: AuntieTools
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNodeData
  lines:
  - Let's see... I have a few dolls lying around... They should be good enough for
    you.
  - 'If you really are empty - these are yours. But if you have any of your own,
    I will not give them to you! '
  - Don't forget you can buy more from the shopkeeper.
  - Yes, that caged thing is our shopkeeper.
  - Also double check if you have any in your inventory! You might've forgotten to
    equip them (Press I to open inventory)
